{"seq":2,"slug":"elimination-reactions","title":"消除反应 E1/E2（Elimination Reactions: E1 and E2）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/reaction-mechanisms/elimination-reactions","wordCount":2368,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"消除反应-e1-e2-elimination-reactions-e1-and-e2\">消除反应 E1/E2（Elimination Reactions: E1 and E2）</h1><h2 id=\"引言\">引言</h2><p>消除反应（Elimination Reaction）是亲核取代的&quot;竞争对手&quot;——在相同底物上，亲核取代和消除反应往往同时进行，产物比例取决于反应条件。消除反应的本质是：从底物分子中移除一个离去基团和一个相邻氢原子（通常位于 β-碳上），在两个碳之间形成一个新的 π 键（双键或三键）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Base</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>H—C</mtext><mi>β</mi></msub><msub><mtext>—C</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub><mtext>—LG</mtext><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mi>β</mi></msub><msub><mtext>=C</mtext><mi>α</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>B—H</mtext><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>LG</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Base} + \\text{H—C}_\\beta\\text{—C}_\\alpha\\text{—LG} \\rightarrow \\text{C}_\\beta\\text{=C}_\\alpha + \\text{B—H} + \\text{LG}^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Base</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H—C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">—C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">—LG</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">=C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">B—H</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>消除反应是烯烃和炔烃合成的主要途径之一，在有机合成中地位重要。与亲核取代类似，消除反应也分为两种主要机理：E2（二级消除）和 E1（一级消除），它们在动力学、立体化学和底物要求上各有特征。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>消除反应的实质是&quot;脱去 β-H 与离去基团，在 α、β 碳之间生成 π 键&quot;</strong>。它与亲核取代共享同一底物、同一离去基团，因此二者总是竞争——理解消除必须同时理解取代。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>E2</strong>：一步协同。强碱夺取 β-H 的同时 C—LG 断裂、π 键形成，过渡态要求 H—C—C—LG 四原子共平面且 H 与 LG 处于<strong>反式共平面</strong>（二面角约 180°）。速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>底物</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>碱</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= k[\\text{底物}][\\text{碱}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">底物</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">碱</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>E1</strong>：两步。先异裂生成碳正离子（与 SN1 共享决速步），再由碱夺 β-H。速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>底物</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= k[\\text{底物}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">底物</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>区域选择性由&quot;碱的位阻&quot;与&quot;烯烃稳定性&quot;两股力博弈决定</strong>：小位阻强碱走 Zaitsev 路线（最稳定、取代最多的烯烃）；大位阻碱（t-BuOK、LDA）难以接近位阻大的内部 β-H，转而夺末端氢，生成 Hofmann 产物（末端烯烃）。立体化学上，E2 的反式共平面要求使产物的 E/Z 构型由起始物构型严格决定。</p>\n<p><strong>常见误解</strong>：把 Zaitsev 规则当作不可违反的定律。它是热力学倾向的总结，凡改变碱的位阻或底物几何（如反式共平面不可得的刚性环系），都可能得到&quot;非 Zaitsev&quot;产物，这正是 Hofmann 消除合成末端烯烃的依据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  SUB[&quot;R-CH₂-CH₂-LG + Base&quot;] --&gt; P{&quot;机理/条件&quot;}&#10;  P --&gt;|&quot;强碱, 尤其大位阻&quot;| E2[&quot;E2 一步协同&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt;|&quot;弱碱/无外加碱, 质子溶剂加热&quot;| E1[&quot;E1 两步&quot;]&#10;  E2 --&gt; E2a[&quot;反式共平面过渡态&quot;]&#10;  E2 --&gt; E2b[&quot;二级动力学&quot;]&#10;  E2 --&gt; E2c[&quot;小位阻碱→Zaitsev, 大位阻碱→Hofmann&quot;]&#10;  E1 --&gt; E1a[&quot;碳正离子中间体&quot;]&#10;  E1 --&gt; E1b[&quot;一级动力学&quot;]&#10;  E1 --&gt; E1c[&quot;Zaitsev 产物 + 可能重排&quot;]\">graph TD\n  SUB[\"R-CH₂-CH₂-LG + Base\"] --&gt; P{\"机理/条件\"}\n  P --&gt;|\"强碱, 尤其大位阻\"| E2[\"E2 一步协同\"]\n  P --&gt;|\"弱碱/无外加碱, 质子溶剂加热\"| E1[\"E1 两步\"]\n  E2 --&gt; E2a[\"反式共平面过渡态\"]\n  E2 --&gt; E2b[\"二级动力学\"]\n  E2 --&gt; E2c[\"小位阻碱→Zaitsev, 大位阻碱→Hofmann\"]\n  E1 --&gt; E1a[\"碳正离子中间体\"]\n  E1 --&gt; E1b[\"一级动力学\"]\n  E1 --&gt; E1c[\"Zaitsev 产物 + 可能重排\"]</pre><h2 id=\"e2-反应机理\">E2 反应机理</h2><h3 id=\"一步协同消除\">一步协同消除</h3><p>E2（Elimination Bimolecular）与 SN2 类似，是一步协同反应。碱夺取 β-H 的同时，电子流向 α-碳，C—LG 键断裂，π 键形成——所有键的断裂和形成在同一过渡态中完成。</p>\n<p>过渡态结构要求：H—C<em>β—C</em>α—LG 四个原子必须处于同一平面（共平面），且 H 和 LG 呈<strong>反式共平面</strong>（Anti-periplanar）排列，二面角约 180°。这一几何要求称为<strong>反式共平面消除</strong>（Anti-periplanar Elimination）。</p>\n<p>物理原因：当 H 和 LG 呈反式共平面时，C—H σ 键与 C—LG σ* 反键轨道之间的重叠最大化，σ → σ* 相互作用使键断裂能垒最低。同时，正在形成的 π 键所需的 p 轨道重叠也在此几何下最优。</p>\n<h3 id=\"动力学特征\">动力学特征</h3><p>E2 反应速率取决于底物和碱的浓度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Substrate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Base</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Rate} = k[\\text{Substrate}][\\text{Base}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Substrate</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Base</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>二级动力学。碱的浓度和强度直接影响反应速率——这是区分 E2 和 E1 的关键实验手段。</p>\n<h3 id=\"立体化学特征\">立体化学特征</h3><p>E2 反应的反式共平面要求产生两个重要的立体化学推论：</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1：确定的产物构型</strong></p>\n<p>对于环己烷底物，只有处于 1,2-trans-diaxial（反式双轴向）关系的 H 和 LG 才满足反式共平面条件。这意味着：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>环己烷的 E2 消除必须从特定的椅式构象发生</li>\n<li>产物的 E/Z 构型由起始物的立体化学严格决定</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>推论 2：区域选择性的约束</strong></p>\n<p>当底物有多个 β-H 可供消除时，只有能与 LG 形成反式共平面的那些 β-H 才能参与 E2。这有时会导致与 Zaitsev 规则不同的产物（即&quot;非 Zaitsev 产物&quot;或&quot;Hofmann 产物&quot;）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"区域选择性-regioselectivity\">区域选择性（Regioselectivity）</h3><p>当 β-碳上有多个可消除位置时，E2 的产物遵循以下规则：</p>\n<p><strong>Zaitsev 规则</strong>（1875，Alexander Zaitsev）：消除反应倾向于生成<strong>取代程度最高的烯烃</strong>（即最稳定的烯烃）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>稳定性：三取代 &gt; 二取代 &gt; 一取代烯烃</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{稳定性：三取代 &gt; 二取代 &gt; 一取代烯烃}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">稳定性：三取代</span><span class=\"mord\"> &gt; </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">二取代</span><span class=\"mord\"> &gt; </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">一取代烯烃</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>原因：过渡态结构部分呈现产物烯烃的特征（Hammond 假说），更稳定的烯烃对应更低能量的过渡态。</p>\n<p><strong>Hofmann 规则的例外</strong>：使用体积庞大的碱（如叔丁醇钾 t-BuOK）时，碱因空间位阻难以接近位阻较大的 β-H，转而夺取位阻较小的末端 β-H，生成取代程度低的烯烃（Hofmann 产物）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"碱的选择\">碱的选择</h3><p>E2 反应需要强碱。常用碱按碱性和位阻排序：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>碱</th>\n<th>碱性</th>\n<th>位阻</th>\n<th>产物倾向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NaOEt（乙醇钠）</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>Zaitsev</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>t-BuOK（叔丁醇钾）</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>Hofmann</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DBU</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>Zaitsev</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LDA（二异丙基氨基锂）</td>\n<td>极强</td>\n<td>极大</td>\n<td>Hofmann</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"e1-反应机理\">E1 反应机理</h2><h3 id=\"两步消除\">两步消除</h3><p>E1（Elimination Unimolecular）与 SN1 共享第一步——碳正离子的形成：</p>\n<p><strong>步骤 1</strong>（决速步）：C—LG 键异裂，生成碳正离子。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>R—LG</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>slow</mtext></mpadded></mover><msup><mtext>R</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>LG</mtext><mo>−</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R—LG} \\xrightarrow{\\text{slow}} \\text{R}^+ + \\text{LG}^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—LG</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">slow</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9279em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LG</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>步骤 2</strong>（快步）：碱（通常是溶剂分子）从碳正离子的 β-碳上夺取一个质子，同时形成 π 键。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>R</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><mtext>Base</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>fast</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Alkene</mtext><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext>B—H</mtext><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R}^+ + \\text{Base} \\xrightarrow{\\text{fast}} \\text{Alkene} + \\text{B—H}^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9279em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Base</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fast</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Alkene</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">B—H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8446em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"动力学与底物要求\">动力学与底物要求</h3><p>E1 为一级动力学：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Rate</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Substrate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Rate} = k[\\text{Substrate}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rate</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Substrate</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>与 SN1 相同，E1 需要能形成稳定碳正离子的底物（叔碳 &gt; 仲碳），且在极性质子溶剂中进行。E1 消除和 SN1 取代总是<strong>同时竞争</strong>——使用叔碳底物在水或醇中反应，产物通常是取代产物和消除产物的混合物。</p>\n<p>提高温度有利于消除产物：消除的活化熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>S</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">‡</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta S^{\\ddagger}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">‡</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为正值（从一个分子变为两个分子），高温对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>G</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">‡</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">‡</mo></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>S</mi><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">‡</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta G^{\\ddagger} = \\Delta H^{\\ddagger} - T\\Delta S^{\\ddagger}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">‡</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9324em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">‡</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">‡</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中消除路径更有利。</p>\n<h3 id=\"区域选择性\">区域选择性</h3><p>E1 消除产物也遵循 Zaitsev 规则——优先形成最稳定的烯烃。原因：碳正离子中间体的 β-H 脱去后，形成的烯烃越稳定（超共轭越充分），该路径的过渡态能量越低。</p>\n<h3 id=\"碳正离子重排与-e1\">碳正离子重排与 E1</h3><p>与 SN1 类似，E1 反应中碳正离子也可能发生重排。重排后的碳正离子随后脱质子形成烯烃——产物可能包含碳骨架已经改变的烯烃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"e2-与-e1-的竞争判断\">E2 与 E1 的竞争判断</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素</th>\n<th>有利于 E2</th>\n<th>有利于 E1</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碱</td>\n<td>强碱、高浓度</td>\n<td>弱碱/无碱（溶剂）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底物</td>\n<td>所有类型（尤其伯碳）</td>\n<td>叔碳、仲碳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>溶剂</td>\n<td>极性非质子</td>\n<td>极性质子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高温</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>实际规律简化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有强碱参与 → E2</li>\n<li>无外加碱、叔碳底物在质子性溶剂中加热 → E1（与 SN1 竞争）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"取代与消除的竞争\">取代与消除的竞争</h2><p>在实际有机合成中，SN2/E2 和 SN1/E1 往往同时发生。如何控制产物比例是实验设计的关键：</p>\n<h3 id=\"sn2-vs-e2-的控制\">SN2 vs E2 的控制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>偏向 SN2</th>\n<th>偏向 E2</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>亲核试剂/碱</td>\n<td>强亲核、弱碱</td>\n<td>强碱、弱亲核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碱的体积</td>\n<td>小（CH₃O⁻）</td>\n<td>大（t-BuO⁻）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>底物</td>\n<td>甲基、伯碳</td>\n<td>仲碳、叔碳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>温度</td>\n<td>低温</td>\n<td>高温</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>经验法则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>甲基/伯碳底物 + 好亲核试剂 → SN2 主导</li>\n<li>仲碳/叔碳底物 + 强位阻碱 → E2 主导</li>\n<li>叔碳底物 + 弱亲核试剂在质子溶剂中 → SN1 和 E1 混合</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"sn1-vs-e1-的控制\">SN1 vs E1 的控制</h3><p>由于 SN1 和 E1 共享同一碳正离子中间体，在多数条件下两者同时发生。高温有利于 E1（熵驱动），低温有利于 SN1。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合成应用实例\">合成应用实例</h2><h3 id=\"脱水制备烯烃\">脱水制备烯烃</h3><p>醇在酸性条件下（浓 H₂SO₄，170°C）发生 E1 脱水是制备烯烃的经典方法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>R—CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>—CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>—OH</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>SO</mtext><mn>4</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover><msub><mtext>R—CH=CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>O</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R—CH}_2\\text{—CH}_2\\text{—OH} \\xrightarrow{\\text{H}_2\\text{SO}_4, \\Delta} \\text{R—CH=CH}_2 + \\text{H}_2\\text{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2503em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">—CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">—OH</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3173em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">Δ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—CH=CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">O</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>机理：醇先被质子化（—OH₂⁺ 是好的离去基团 → 水），然后经 E1 或 E2 脱质子形成烯烃。伯醇多走 E2，叔醇走 E1。</p>\n<h3 id=\"hofmann-消除制备末端烯烃\">Hofmann 消除制备末端烯烃</h3><p>当需要选择性合成末端烯烃时，Hofmann 消除条件（大位阻碱如 t-BuOK）优于 Zaitsev 条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CH(Br)CH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext>-BuOK</mtext><mo>→</mo><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CH=CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext> (主)</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CH=CHCH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mtext> (次)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CH}_3\\text{CH}_2\\text{CH(Br)CH}_3 + t\\text{-BuOK} \\rightarrow \\text{CH}_3\\text{CH}_2\\text{CH=CH}_2 \\text{ (主)} + \\text{CH}_3\\text{CH=CHCH}_3 \\text{ (次)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH(Br)CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-BuOK</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH=CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> (</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">主</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH=CHCH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> (</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">次</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"e2-在天然产物合成中的应用\">E2 在天然产物合成中的应用</h3><p>逆合成分析中，目标分子中的双键常可通过 E2 消除从相应的卤代烃或磺酸酯前体获得。反式共平面要求提供了精确的立体化学控制——这在构建 E-或 Z-烯烃时尤为有用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章小结\">本章小结</h2><p>消除反应与亲核取代是有机化学中最核心的&quot;竞争对&quot;。核心要点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>E2</strong>：一步协同、二级动力学、反式共平面要求、强碱驱动</li>\n<li><strong>E1</strong>：两步经碳正离子、一级动力学、Zaitsev 产物、弱碱/高温</li>\n<li><strong>区域选择性</strong>：Zaitsev 规则（最稳定烯烃）vs Hofmann 规则（大位阻碱 → 末端烯烃）</li>\n<li><strong>竞争控制</strong>：底物结构、碱的类型和强度、温度、溶剂共同决定 SN/E 比例</li>\n<li><strong>合成应用</strong>：脱水制烯、Hofmann 消除、立体选择性 E2 消除</li>\n</ol>\n<p>理解消除反应机理后，面对有机合成中&quot;如何引入双键&quot;的问题就有了系统的解决方案——通过选择合适的底物结构、碱和反应条件，精确控制产物的构型和位置。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"消除反应 E1/E2（Elimination Reactions: E1 and E2）","id":"消除反应-e1-e2-elimination-reactions-e1-and-e2"},{"level":2,"text":"引言","id":"引言"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"E2 反应机理","id":"e2-反应机理"},{"level":3,"text":"一步协同消除","id":"一步协同消除"},{"level":3,"text":"动力学特征","id":"动力学特征"},{"level":3,"text":"立体化学特征","id":"立体化学特征"},{"level":3,"text":"区域选择性（Regioselectivity）","id":"区域选择性-regioselectivity"},{"level":3,"text":"碱的选择","id":"碱的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"E1 反应机理","id":"e1-反应机理"},{"level":3,"text":"两步消除","id":"两步消除"},{"level":3,"text":"动力学与底物要求","id":"动力学与底物要求"},{"level":3,"text":"区域选择性","id":"区域选择性"},{"level":3,"text":"碳正离子重排与 E1","id":"碳正离子重排与-e1"},{"level":2,"text":"E2 与 E1 的竞争判断","id":"e2-与-e1-的竞争判断"},{"level":2,"text":"取代与消除的竞争","id":"取代与消除的竞争"},{"level":3,"text":"SN2 vs E2 的控制","id":"sn2-vs-e2-的控制"},{"level":3,"text":"SN1 vs E1 的控制","id":"sn1-vs-e1-的控制"},{"level":2,"text":"合成应用实例","id":"合成应用实例"},{"level":3,"text":"脱水制备烯烃","id":"脱水制备烯烃"},{"level":3,"text":"Hofmann 消除制备末端烯烃","id":"hofmann-消除制备末端烯烃"},{"level":3,"text":"E2 在天然产物合成中的应用","id":"e2-在天然产物合成中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"本章小结","id":"本章小结"}],"prev":{"title":"亲核取代反应 SN1/SN2（Nucleophilic Substitution: SN1 and SN2）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/reaction-mechanisms/nucleophilic-substitution"},"next":{"title":"加成反应（Addition Reactions）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/reaction-mechanisms/addition-reactions"}}